WEBVTT

00:00:18.210 --> 00:00:23.950
<i>Every day I keep wondering if</i>
<i>there's something missing.</i>

00:00:25.450 --> 00:00:31.290
<i>I still want to keep feeling my</i>
<i>heart beating in anticipation.</i>

00:00:31.350 --> 00:00:39.020
<i>Ideals are far out of reach, but</i>
<i>reality is within my grasp.</i>

00:00:39.130 --> 00:00:45.100
<i>It's not easy standing against the wind,</i>
<i>but as long as I keep smiling...</i>

00:00:45.200 --> 00:00:49.870
<i>... staying true to myself,</i>
<i>I'll become stronger.</i>

00:00:50.070 --> 00:00:57.650
<i>I know I'll love somebody. Someday</i>
<i>I'll find him and take my chance.</i>

00:00:57.710 --> 00:01:04.620
<i>I'll make the whole world stop</i>
<i>to see the angel that I'll be.</i>

00:01:04.690 --> 00:01:12.550
<i>I know I'll love somebody. Someday</i>
<i>I'll meet the man of my dreams.</i>

00:01:12.660 --> 00:01:20.230
<i>Nothing can slow me down. Tomorrow</i>
<i>is just around the corner.</i>

00:01:53.000 --> 00:01:53.400
"The Bodunan Driving Academy"

00:01:53.400 --> 00:01:55.400
Help me!

00:01:55.400 --> 00:01:56.840
"The Bodunan Driving Academy"

00:01:57.170 --> 00:01:58.640
Traffic Safety First"

00:01:59.880 --> 00:02:01.740
Lesson complete.

00:02:01.840 --> 00:02:03.810
Well, how'd I do today?

00:02:06.150 --> 00:02:09.480
Huh? Is something
the matter?

00:02:09.580 --> 00:02:13.880
Hmm. I guess I have to try to take
those corners a little sharper.

00:02:14.760 --> 00:02:16.450
Just a bit more.

00:02:21.000 --> 00:02:21.960
Wow!

00:02:22.430 --> 00:02:24.730
All right! Perfect score!

00:02:25.300 --> 00:02:27.430
Hey! You okay?
Hang in there!

00:02:27.840 --> 00:02:32.830
FILE. 27
THE ABC'S OF
DRIVING

00:02:36.880 --> 00:02:39.070
995...

00:02:39.250 --> 00:02:41.650
996...

00:02:43.220 --> 00:02:44.880
999...

00:02:45.120 --> 00:02:46.880
Aren't you about finished?

00:02:47.160 --> 00:02:48.090
1,000!

00:02:48.920 --> 00:02:50.980
And that's it for
my warm-up!

00:02:52.290 --> 00:02:53.160
Chief!

00:02:53.160 --> 00:02:54.460
Hmm?

00:02:55.700 --> 00:02:58.390
I'll be leaving
early today!

00:02:58.630 --> 00:02:59.000
I see.

00:02:59.000 --> 00:03:00.070
"Request to Leave Early"

00:03:00.070 --> 00:03:02.870
Don't push yourself so hard that
it interferes with your life.

00:03:02.870 --> 00:03:03.410
"Request to Leave Early"

00:03:03.410 --> 00:03:05.870
I want to give it my
very best shot, sir!

00:03:07.080 --> 00:03:09.740
Well, trying hard
is a good thing.

00:03:10.310 --> 00:03:11.240
Anyway, do your best.

00:03:11.850 --> 00:03:13.250
Y... Yes, sir!

00:03:13.520 --> 00:03:17.710
I'll definitely get my license soon,
so I can help you more, Chief!

00:03:17.850 --> 00:03:19.980
Uh... please do.

00:03:21.060 --> 00:03:22.460
Well then, I'm off!

00:03:25.260 --> 00:03:27.390
Gee, Natsumi sure is pumped!

00:03:27.660 --> 00:03:30.060
And she certainly has the Section
Chief backing her.

00:03:30.330 --> 00:03:35.170
Still, I wonder why she wants to go
to driving school all of a sudden?

00:03:35.600 --> 00:03:36.830
For the sake
of her work.

00:03:36.940 --> 00:03:40.100
For the world. For the people. At least,
that's what she's been saying.

00:03:40.310 --> 00:03:42.000
Well, good for her.

00:03:42.210 --> 00:03:44.410
Nakajima, do you
really think so?

00:03:44.710 --> 00:03:46.580
If Natsumi does get her
driver's license...

00:03:46.750 --> 00:03:48.510
<i>"Run! Gotta run!"</i>

00:03:48.680 --> 00:03:50.480
<i>"Stop where you are!"</i>

00:03:50.620 --> 00:03:54.950
<i>"Ain't gonna!</i>
<i>No way!"</i>

00:03:55.120 --> 00:03:57.090
<i>"You won't get away</i>
<i>from me!"</i>

00:04:04.070 --> 00:04:04.930
Oh, no!

00:04:05.100 --> 00:04:06.690
This is what would
really happen!

00:04:06.940 --> 00:04:08.530
What a disaster!

00:04:12.940 --> 00:04:15.140
She really is gung ho
about this.

00:04:16.850 --> 00:04:20.210
Hey, do you think Tsujimoto will
be able to get her auto license?

00:04:20.650 --> 00:04:22.740
I'm betting she won't.

00:04:22.920 --> 00:04:23.820
So am I.

00:04:23.990 --> 00:04:24.820
No kidding.

00:04:24.990 --> 00:04:26.920
She'll never make it!

00:04:27.090 --> 00:04:28.110
You're right!

00:04:28.290 --> 00:04:30.050
Hmm...

00:04:30.930 --> 00:04:32.290
Oh, Kobayakawa.

00:04:32.460 --> 00:04:33.890
Yes, sir?

00:04:34.000 --> 00:04:34.860
What is it?

00:04:35.030 --> 00:04:37.060
Do you think Tsujimoto's
gonna get it?

00:04:37.230 --> 00:04:38.220
Huh?

00:04:38.400 --> 00:04:40.930
Her automobile driver's
license, what else!

00:04:41.040 --> 00:04:44.730
I can imagine what her
driving will be like.

00:04:45.110 --> 00:04:48.740
However... I was wondering what
you think, Kobayakawa.

00:04:49.440 --> 00:04:52.410
Oh... Well... How
shall I put it?

00:04:53.380 --> 00:04:55.650
I think that if she does
get her license...

00:04:55.850 --> 00:04:58.290
I'd be really impressed with
both her and her examiner.

00:04:58.850 --> 00:05:01.650
Hmm... Impressed, huh?

00:05:03.490 --> 00:05:05.460
I don't know...

00:05:29.580 --> 00:05:32.280
<i>"Nice driving, Tsujimoto."</i>

00:05:32.550 --> 00:05:34.180
<i>"You're too kind."</i>

00:05:35.390 --> 00:05:38.260
<i>"At this rate, you'll be a Formula</i>
<i>One racer in no time."</i>

00:05:41.330 --> 00:05:42.800
<i>"Oh, Chief, you flatter me!"</i>

00:05:43.030 --> 00:05:45.430
<i>"Not at all."</i>

00:05:45.800 --> 00:05:46.770
<i>"Hey!"</i>

00:05:48.300 --> 00:05:49.670
"No Speed Limit"

00:05:49.670 --> 00:05:51.500
<i>"Yahoo!"</i>
"No Speed Limit"

00:06:12.390 --> 00:06:13.450
Chief...

00:06:14.560 --> 00:06:18.660
Let's go to a hot spring,
then to a karaoke bar.

00:06:22.940 --> 00:06:24.910
Yeah! I'm gonna do it!

00:06:35.820 --> 00:06:36.720
Hey, Yoriko.

00:06:37.020 --> 00:06:37.990
Yeah?

00:06:38.150 --> 00:06:40.420
We've almost finished
our shift, right?

00:06:41.020 --> 00:06:42.010
Yup.

00:06:42.120 --> 00:06:43.720
Just have to go back to
the station, that's all.

00:06:43.890 --> 00:06:46.220
Mind if we don't go
straight back?

00:06:46.800 --> 00:06:47.780
How come?

00:06:48.030 --> 00:06:50.160
Well, I just want to check
up on something.

00:06:50.430 --> 00:06:51.960
I get it! Natsumi,
right?!

00:06:52.070 --> 00:06:53.060
Okay!

00:06:57.510 --> 00:07:01.000
That's right. And that's how you
do artificial resuscitation.

00:07:05.180 --> 00:07:07.440
Oo... Oops. Sorry.

00:07:10.890 --> 00:07:11.980
Attention staff.

00:07:12.150 --> 00:07:15.750
All cars out on the course
are to be returned.

00:07:15.860 --> 00:07:19.380
I repeat. All cars out on the
course are to be returned.

00:07:28.500 --> 00:07:29.830
Holy cow!

00:07:33.310 --> 00:07:35.830
What's with all
these people?

00:07:38.710 --> 00:07:39.680
Chief?!

00:07:39.850 --> 00:07:43.110
D'oh! Uh... Kobayakawa
and Nikaidou...

00:07:43.280 --> 00:07:45.080
What are you
doing here?

00:07:45.350 --> 00:07:50.050
Well, they say you need to check
out the paddock before the race.

00:07:50.330 --> 00:07:51.380
Huh?

00:07:52.460 --> 00:07:53.950
Here she comes!

00:07:56.430 --> 00:07:59.090
Thank you! Thank you!

00:07:59.730 --> 00:08:00.960
That's Natsumi!

00:08:01.240 --> 00:08:03.700
Oh, thank you! Thank you!

00:08:04.910 --> 00:08:08.930
<i>Oh Lord, please let today</i>
<i>pass uneventfully...</i>

00:08:09.040 --> 00:08:12.240
<i>... and allow me to make</i>
<i>it back alive.</i>

00:08:15.280 --> 00:08:17.050
I've checked the rear...

00:08:17.220 --> 00:08:19.450
...and I'm ready to roll!

00:08:19.620 --> 00:08:20.380
O... Okay.

00:08:30.830 --> 00:08:31.960
Stopped in time!

00:08:34.240 --> 00:08:35.730
Both directions checked,
and here we go!

00:08:38.770 --> 00:08:39.900
S-curve!

00:08:41.140 --> 00:08:41.810
And then downshift!

00:08:41.810 --> 00:08:46.680
Oh, no! I can't reach the brake!

00:08:54.720 --> 00:08:56.690
Accelerate!

00:09:06.400 --> 00:09:07.270
Well?

00:09:07.370 --> 00:09:09.840
Do you think my special training
has helped? Pretty good, huh?

00:09:16.310 --> 00:09:17.210
Wow!

00:09:17.310 --> 00:09:20.340
All right! Another
pass!

00:09:20.620 --> 00:09:22.450
Hey, are you all
right?! Hey!

00:09:26.490 --> 00:09:29.010
How on earth did
she pass?!

00:09:29.120 --> 00:09:30.460
I... I don't know...

00:09:45.070 --> 00:09:47.540
Maybe I'm not cut out
for this type of work.

00:09:52.310 --> 00:09:53.370
Don't worry.

00:09:54.180 --> 00:09:56.580
"Sempai;" A mentor, big-brother figure, etc.
S... Sempai!

00:09:56.580 --> 00:09:57.450
I understand.

00:09:57.890 --> 00:10:00.650
Letting that student out
onto the roads...

00:10:00.760 --> 00:10:03.550
...would be like setting
loose a rabid dog!

00:10:04.490 --> 00:10:07.550
I won't allow it!

00:10:08.500 --> 00:10:10.590
We have to preserve our reputation
as driving instructors!

00:10:10.700 --> 00:10:13.220
We can't let her get her
license like this!

00:10:14.140 --> 00:10:15.100
Sempai!

00:10:15.270 --> 00:10:16.700
Don't worry!

00:10:16.800 --> 00:10:20.370
I won't let your noble sacrifice
be without meaning.

00:10:20.540 --> 00:10:23.410
Uh, it's not as if I've
died or anything.

00:10:24.180 --> 00:10:25.770
Behold!

00:10:26.920 --> 00:10:29.820
These men are the top mechanics at this
school, and they're all on our side.

00:10:30.520 --> 00:10:31.820
Them, too!

00:10:32.490 --> 00:10:33.820
They all feel the
same as I do.

00:10:34.890 --> 00:10:38.920
And if we work together,
we can make sure that...

00:10:39.060 --> 00:10:42.760
...girls like her are properly
re-educated!

00:10:43.700 --> 00:10:45.930
So there's no need
for you to worry.

00:10:46.130 --> 00:10:48.030
You can rest
in peace.

00:10:48.300 --> 00:10:49.270
Umm...

00:10:49.400 --> 00:10:50.890
Amen.

00:10:59.580 --> 00:11:00.610
Good morning!

00:11:01.180 --> 00:11:04.380
I, Natsumi Tsujimoto, am the proud
holder of a learner's permit!

00:11:04.690 --> 00:11:08.210
What?! How can that be?
That's impossible!

00:11:08.460 --> 00:11:09.320
"Will Tsujimoto pass her driver's test?"

00:11:09.320 --> 00:11:13.660
What?! What the? I lost!

00:11:13.660 --> 00:11:13.800
"Will Tsujimoto pass her driver's test?"

00:11:13.800 --> 00:11:14.500
No way! I can't believe it!

00:11:14.500 --> 00:11:17.230
"YES"
"Section Chief"

00:11:17.230 --> 00:11:19.530
No way! I can't believe it!

00:11:19.770 --> 00:11:21.890
Chief! I did it!

00:11:22.070 --> 00:11:23.830
Yeah. You've almost made it.

00:11:24.670 --> 00:11:26.800
I'm the only one who
believes in you.

00:11:28.380 --> 00:11:29.810
Chief!

00:11:31.710 --> 00:11:34.880
I will do my best to live up to
your expectations, Chief!

00:11:38.850 --> 00:11:42.150
"Training Room"

00:11:49.930 --> 00:11:51.960
She sure is putting everything
into it this time.

00:11:52.170 --> 00:11:55.330
Yeah. There's nothing
that can stop her now.

00:11:55.570 --> 00:11:57.660
But what's she lifting
weights for?

00:11:57.870 --> 00:11:59.860
Because she got her
learner's permit.

00:12:00.210 --> 00:12:03.300
You mean she's toning up for when
she gets to drive on the streets?

00:12:03.810 --> 00:12:04.470
Huh?

00:12:04.750 --> 00:12:05.850
That's right.

00:12:05.850 --> 00:12:07.340
Miyuki?

00:12:07.580 --> 00:12:11.380
Somehow or other she managed
to get her learner's permit.

00:12:12.290 --> 00:12:16.880
It means that she's started training
for her driver's license.

00:12:17.290 --> 00:12:20.230
If she goes out on the road
with that kind of driving...

00:12:20.800 --> 00:12:23.700
<i>"Get outta my</i>
<i>way, buster!"</i>

00:12:24.200 --> 00:12:26.170
<i>"Woo-hoo!"</i>

00:12:29.000 --> 00:12:30.940
Hmm... I see what
you mean.

00:12:31.110 --> 00:12:33.130
Y... You can't be serious!

00:12:33.370 --> 00:12:36.210
You'd know exactly what she means
if you'd seen Natsumi drive.

00:12:38.350 --> 00:12:39.970
We'll just have
to use it.

00:12:45.550 --> 00:12:47.150
Hey, Natsumi...

00:12:47.920 --> 00:12:50.760
Interested in a training machine that's
just for those with learner's permits?

00:12:51.390 --> 00:12:52.860
I am! I am!

00:13:01.570 --> 00:13:03.470
Today's the day I start training
for my real license!

00:13:04.470 --> 00:13:06.570
I won't let the instructor
see a single mistake.

00:13:10.210 --> 00:13:12.810
Ah! P... Pleased to
meet you, sir!

00:13:20.960 --> 00:13:23.050
I've started the car, sir.

00:13:23.360 --> 00:13:24.760
I'm sure you already
understand.

00:13:25.490 --> 00:13:28.520
From this point on, everything
will be completely different.

00:13:28.760 --> 00:13:31.060
Yes, sir! And I promise
to do my very best!

00:13:32.170 --> 00:13:35.570
<i>We'll see about that.</i>

00:13:36.000 --> 00:13:38.470
All right, sir. I, Natsumi Tsujimoto,
am ready to start.

00:13:44.080 --> 00:13:44.870
Huh?

00:13:49.920 --> 00:13:51.680
Everything feels kind
of different.

00:13:51.920 --> 00:13:53.150
Is there a problem?

00:13:53.350 --> 00:13:54.840
Oh, it's nothing.

00:13:56.320 --> 00:13:58.880
<i>Maybe I've just been working</i>
<i>out too hard.</i>

00:14:01.130 --> 00:14:02.390
<i>She noticed.</i>

00:14:02.960 --> 00:14:06.960
<i>This car is Special Training Vehicle</i>
<i>13, built by our best mechanics...</i>

00:14:07.070 --> 00:14:12.560
<i>... to counter the habits</i>
<i>of reckless drivers.</i>

00:14:12.740 --> 00:14:15.230
<i>The pedals, the gearshift,</i>
<i>and the steering wheel...</i>

00:14:15.340 --> 00:14:19.840
<i>... all the controls were rebuilt to</i>
<i>give the greatest resistance.</i>

00:14:20.450 --> 00:14:23.350
<i>It won't be that simple</i>
<i>for her to handle.</i>

00:14:35.260 --> 00:14:37.670
Hey! Don't forget to check the rear!

00:14:37.670 --> 00:14:38.000
Hey! Don't forget to check the rear!
Yes, sir!

00:14:38.000 --> 00:14:38.070
Yes, sir!

00:14:38.070 --> 00:14:39.430
And you forgot the visual check!

00:14:39.430 --> 00:14:40.830
Y... Yes, sir!

00:14:41.000 --> 00:14:42.440
Keep the speed constant!

00:14:42.440 --> 00:14:43.870
Sorry, sir!

00:14:44.370 --> 00:14:49.970
<i>Back when I was a cop, I wasn't known</i>
<i>as the Traffic Rule Devil for nothing!</i>

00:14:54.150 --> 00:14:55.240
You braked too late!

00:14:55.550 --> 00:14:56.410
Yes, sir.

00:14:58.490 --> 00:15:00.750
What's the matter?
Tired?

00:15:00.960 --> 00:15:01.850
No, not at all.

00:15:05.490 --> 00:15:10.900
<i>Her hands and legs should be feeling</i>
<i>as heavy as lead by now.</i>

00:15:14.600 --> 00:15:15.330
Uh-oh!

00:15:17.710 --> 00:15:18.930
Great!

00:15:19.170 --> 00:15:20.470
Hey! Why don't you watch
where you're going?!

00:15:21.440 --> 00:15:23.540
Hey! Hey...

00:15:24.680 --> 00:15:25.770
Watch it!

00:15:27.280 --> 00:15:28.410
Oh!

00:15:28.520 --> 00:15:30.010
A hit-and-run!

00:15:31.690 --> 00:15:33.710
Hey! What do you think
you're doing?!

00:15:37.890 --> 00:15:39.920
This is an emergency.

00:15:41.400 --> 00:15:43.190
<i>"There's no way you can</i>
<i>fail the test now...</i>

00:15:43.360 --> 00:15:47.030
<i>"...with this equipment and all the</i>
<i>working out you've done."</i>

00:15:47.270 --> 00:15:48.530
<i>"Wow!"</i>

00:15:48.700 --> 00:15:50.470
<i>"Thanks a lot, Miyuki!"</i>

00:15:52.770 --> 00:15:54.500
Our practice will have
to be put on hold.

00:15:55.940 --> 00:15:57.040
<i>What on earth's</i>
<i>going on here?</i>

00:15:57.180 --> 00:16:00.980
<i>She's been driving with</i>
<i>all that gear on!</i>

00:16:02.920 --> 00:16:05.390
Natsumi Full Power, On!

00:16:18.300 --> 00:16:20.100
Nice getaway. They'll
never catch me.

00:16:22.270 --> 00:16:23.240
There's my man.

00:16:24.240 --> 00:16:27.000
Speeding, running
a red light...

00:16:27.210 --> 00:16:28.870
...failing to stop for
pedestrians...

00:16:28.980 --> 00:16:30.740
...and failing to use
his signals.

00:16:30.850 --> 00:16:33.710
Oh? And passing
illegally, too!

00:16:34.020 --> 00:16:39.150
<i>She's doing well, for someone who</i>
<i>slept her way through the lectures.</i>

00:16:51.400 --> 00:16:53.130
What do they want?

00:16:53.330 --> 00:16:56.390
What are you following
that truck for?!

00:16:56.600 --> 00:16:59.000
I can't let a dangerous driver
like that get away.

00:16:59.170 --> 00:17:01.070
Leave that up
to the police.

00:17:01.740 --> 00:17:04.230
I'm going to catch him
and arrest him.

00:17:04.510 --> 00:17:05.600
What?!

00:17:06.750 --> 00:17:08.310
"License Application"

00:17:08.650 --> 00:17:10.150
"Occupation; Public Servant"

00:17:10.150 --> 00:17:10.740
Y... You!

00:17:11.250 --> 00:17:14.350
It says you're a public servant!
You're not a...

00:17:14.860 --> 00:17:16.690
I certainly am!

00:17:22.660 --> 00:17:27.290
Huh? Wasn't that a BMW
from the driving center?

00:17:27.600 --> 00:17:28.590
I don't believe it.

00:17:29.200 --> 00:17:31.140
Let's follow them!

00:17:32.810 --> 00:17:34.370
That car's getting
on my nerves.

00:17:47.720 --> 00:17:48.710
Stop this car!

00:17:51.260 --> 00:17:53.320
My brakes don't work!

00:17:56.500 --> 00:18:00.900
Oh... Oh, no! They adjusted the
resistance on my brakes, too!

00:18:09.740 --> 00:18:12.110
Th... Thank goodness.

00:18:13.880 --> 00:18:15.870
You idiot! Quit driving
like a maniac!

00:18:16.180 --> 00:18:17.380
Y... Yes, sir!

00:18:17.520 --> 00:18:20.250
Look left and right, check
the rearview...

00:18:20.450 --> 00:18:21.890
...and the side mirrors.

00:18:22.020 --> 00:18:23.580
Look over my shoulder
and do a visual check.

00:18:23.720 --> 00:18:26.190
I forgot to do my checks
before changing lanes.

00:18:26.390 --> 00:18:28.490
That's not what I was
talking about!

00:18:33.800 --> 00:18:35.770
Look out!

00:18:45.810 --> 00:18:46.970
Oopsie...

00:18:47.580 --> 00:18:49.050
I've broken off the
steering wheel.

00:18:52.520 --> 00:18:54.850
Stop this thing!

00:18:55.190 --> 00:18:57.090
Please, please!
Stop this car!

00:19:22.220 --> 00:19:24.120
Th... Thank goodness.

00:19:25.950 --> 00:19:27.780
You said it.

00:19:35.560 --> 00:19:37.220
Natsumi! You okay?

00:19:38.670 --> 00:19:39.720
Sorry, Miyuki.

00:19:40.530 --> 00:19:42.020
I broke this!

00:19:42.200 --> 00:19:43.860
You'll make me another
one, right?

00:19:44.110 --> 00:19:45.330
Yeah, sure.

00:19:49.740 --> 00:19:50.770
Come with me.

00:19:51.010 --> 00:19:52.100
All right...

00:19:56.280 --> 00:19:57.270
Umm...

00:19:57.520 --> 00:19:59.110
What is it?

00:20:00.250 --> 00:20:02.590
Thanks for your cooperation.

00:20:03.520 --> 00:20:06.460
I had no idea you
were a cop.

00:20:07.800 --> 00:20:08.660
I'm sorry.

00:20:09.960 --> 00:20:13.800
I have to admit that I admire
your good instincts.

00:20:14.200 --> 00:20:14.900
Huh?

00:20:15.040 --> 00:20:16.090
D... Do you mean?

00:20:16.300 --> 00:20:16.970
"Test Paper"

00:20:16.970 --> 00:20:18.030
You failed!
"Test Paper"

00:20:18.030 --> 00:20:18.130
You failed!

00:20:19.540 --> 00:20:21.060
Eh?

00:20:21.280 --> 00:20:22.370
That's one thing.

00:20:22.580 --> 00:20:24.440
And this is another.

00:20:34.820 --> 00:20:38.280
All right. Let's have a good,
safe drive, shall we?

00:20:38.560 --> 00:20:39.920
Yes, sir.

00:20:51.540 --> 00:20:52.940
Good morning!

00:20:53.070 --> 00:20:56.300
I, Tsujimoto Natsumi, am the proud
holder of a driver's license!

00:20:56.940 --> 00:20:58.470
Unreal!

00:20:58.650 --> 00:21:00.310
Is she kidding, or what?!

00:21:00.480 --> 00:21:03.310
"Yes"
"Section Chief"

00:21:03.950 --> 00:21:05.820
Sorry folks, looks like
I'm the only winner.

00:21:05.920 --> 00:21:07.910
And that means you're
buying, as promised.

00:21:08.090 --> 00:21:09.180
Yes, sir.

00:21:10.390 --> 00:21:11.420
Chief!

00:21:11.660 --> 00:21:13.920
Oh! Way to go, Tsujimoto!

00:21:14.130 --> 00:21:17.460
Let's go for a drive together.
What do you say, Chief?

00:21:17.670 --> 00:21:19.430
Well, uh...

00:21:19.670 --> 00:21:20.660
I don't believe her!

00:21:20.840 --> 00:21:24.070
Go for it, Chief! How come
you get all the luck?!

00:21:25.770 --> 00:21:26.430
Hang on, here.

00:21:26.770 --> 00:21:28.900
Oh, Miyuki, thanks for
the power harness!

00:21:29.010 --> 00:21:30.480
It gave me all the strength
I needed!

00:21:30.880 --> 00:21:31.410
What?!

00:21:31.410 --> 00:21:32.310
What?!
Glad to hear it!

00:21:35.180 --> 00:21:37.150
A nice long drive, just
the two of us!

00:21:38.420 --> 00:21:39.680
Oh, man...

00:21:39.950 --> 00:21:41.620
Poor Chief!

00:21:41.820 --> 00:21:44.020
What a worry.

00:21:50.230 --> 00:21:51.760
Uh-oh.

00:21:55.070 --> 00:22:00.570
<i>Every time I fall</i>
<i>out of love...</i>

00:22:03.580 --> 00:22:08.580
<i>... everything that I see</i>
<i>turns monochrome.</i>

00:22:11.790 --> 00:22:18.080
<i>We often used to go see the</i>
<i>games at the stadium...</i>

00:22:18.190 --> 00:22:28.200
<i>... but the good old days mean</i>
<i>nothing to me anymore.</i>

00:22:28.270 --> 00:22:42.110
<i>Even after you've gone, I still wanna</i>
<i>tell the world what it is that I love.</i>

00:22:42.450 --> 00:22:50.390
<i>Looking up to the sky, I try</i>
<i>holding back the tears.</i>

00:22:50.460 --> 00:22:59.030
<i>Flags were moving in the wind and</i>
<i>things seemed brighter yesterday.</i>

00:22:59.270 --> 00:23:03.240
<i>Looking up to the sky, we used</i>
<i>to talk about our dreams.</i>

00:23:07.240 --> 00:23:16.680
<i>No matter how far out of reach they seemed,</i>
<i>dreams could come true, or so it felt.</i>

00:23:17.050 --> 00:23:24.120
<i>Tell me that that fire in your</i>
<i>eyes was not a lie.</i>

00:23:26.460 --> 00:23:27.760
"ln The Living Room"

00:23:28.100 --> 00:23:30.360
The lmpostor of Reality or the Real
lmpostor, which is the true fake?

00:23:30.530 --> 00:23:32.290
But they're both
fakes.

00:23:32.470 --> 00:23:35.330
No, listen! There have been a number
of impostors around here lately!

00:23:35.500 --> 00:23:37.370
Oh, you must mean
lmpostor #704.

00:23:37.540 --> 00:23:39.040
Damn, all these uninvited guests...

00:23:39.040 --> 00:23:40.710
What'd the Inviting Cat do?

00:23:40.710 --> 00:23:42.940
No! Not the Inviting Cat...
thieving buffoons!
What'd the Inviting Cat do?

00:23:43.110 --> 00:23:44.080
What about baboons?

00:23:44.080 --> 00:23:44.450
Huh?

00:23:44.450 --> 00:23:46.310
Next time, You're Under Arrest, File 28...

00:23:46.510 --> 00:23:48.280
..."Chase Down lmposter #704!"

00:23:48.420 --> 00:23:49.420
Never chase those that run away.

00:23:49.480 --> 00:23:51.490
We HAVE to chase them!
